{"seq":1,"slug":"gpu-hardware-cuda-abstract","title":"GPU 硬件架构与 CUDA 执行模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/gpu-kubernetes-scheduling-device-plugin-sharing/gpu-device-model-k8s/gpu-hardware-cuda-abstract","wordCount":2812,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"gpu-硬件架构与-cuda-执行模型\">GPU 硬件架构与 CUDA 执行模型</h1><p>一个 <code>nvidia-smi</code> 显示 80GB 显存完全空闲的节点，跑一个 batch size 翻倍的训练任务却直接 OOM；同一个节点上两个推理 pod 各申请半张卡，合并后吞吐反而低于单卡独占。这类问题的根因都不在 Kubernetes ——它们在 SM、warp、寄存器文件与 HBM 的物理约束里。Kubernetes 调度器能看见的只有 <code>nvidia.com/gpu: 1</code> 这样一个整数，而真正决定&quot;这张卡能同时喂几个负载&quot;的量，是 SM 的 warp 槽位、寄存器文件大小与显存带宽。本文把从 SM 到 Grid 的硬件与执行模型讲清楚，作为后面 device plugin、拓扑感知、GPU 切分三章共同的坐标系。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-三层执行层级与两种并行\">核心概念：三层执行层级与两种并行</h2><p>GPU 不是&quot;更快的 CPU&quot;，而是一台<strong>吞吐型</strong>机器：它用大量简单的执行单元 + 极深的延迟隐藏，把&quot;单指令延迟&quot;让位给&quot;单位时间指令数&quot;。CUDA 的执行模型把这张卡抽象成严格的三层容器：<strong>thread</strong>（一个标量执行流）→ <strong>block</strong>（可协作的线程组，共享一块片上 shared memory）→ <strong>grid</strong>（一次 kernel 启动的全部 block）。硬件侧对应的是另一套名字：<strong>thread</strong> 由 <strong>warp</strong> 调度，<strong>block</strong> 落在某一个 <strong>SM（Streaming Multiprocessor）</strong> 上执行，<strong>grid</strong> 分布在整卡的所有 SM 之间。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  Grid[&quot;Grid:一次 kernel 启动&quot;] --&gt; Blk[&quot;Thread Block 0..N&lt;br/&gt;共享 shared memory&quot;]&#10;  Blk --&gt; W[&quot;Warp = 32 threads&lt;br/&gt;SIMT 执行单元&quot;]&#10;  W --&gt; SM[&quot;Streaming Multiprocessor (SM)&lt;br/&gt;warp 调度器 + 执行管线&quot;]&#10;  SM --&gt; Core[&quot;FP32 / INT32 / Tensor Core 管线&quot;]&#10;  SM --&gt; RF[&quot;Register File 256KB/SM&quot;]&#10;  SM --&gt; SMEM[&quot;Shared Memory / L1(可配置切分)&quot;]&#10;  SM --&gt; L2[&quot;L2 Cache(全卡共享)&quot;]&#10;  L2 --&gt; HBM[&quot;HBM3 / HBM3e 显存&quot;]&#10;  Blk -.-&gt;|&quot;block 之间不可同步&quot;| Blk2[&quot;另一 SM 上的 Block&quot;]\">graph TD\n  Grid[\"Grid:一次 kernel 启动\"] --&gt; Blk[\"Thread Block 0..N&lt;br/&gt;共享 shared memory\"]\n  Blk --&gt; W[\"Warp = 32 threads&lt;br/&gt;SIMT 执行单元\"]\n  W --&gt; SM[\"Streaming Multiprocessor (SM)&lt;br/&gt;warp 调度器 + 执行管线\"]\n  SM --&gt; Core[\"FP32 / INT32 / Tensor Core 管线\"]\n  SM --&gt; RF[\"Register File 256KB/SM\"]\n  SM --&gt; SMEM[\"Shared Memory / L1(可配置切分)\"]\n  SM --&gt; L2[\"L2 Cache(全卡共享)\"]\n  L2 --&gt; HBM[\"HBM3 / HBM3e 显存\"]\n  Blk -.-&gt;|\"block 之间不可同步\"| Blk2[\"另一 SM 上的 Block\"]</pre><p>两条关键的不对称贯穿整篇：<strong>thread 之间便宜，block 之间昂贵</strong>。同一个 block 内的线程可以通过 shared memory 与 <code>__syncthreads()</code> 廉价协作；不同 block 之间没有共享的片上存储，也无法在一个 kernel 内同步，只能靠 global memory 与原子操作，代价高出两个数量级。这条界线解释了为什么 GEMM 的实现要把 tile 塞进 shared memory、为什么&quot;跨卡通信&quot;必须走 NVLink 而不是显存——也解释了容器里的 GPU 切分（时间片、MPS、MIG）为什么在语义上如此不同。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>CPU</th>\n<th>GPU</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>设计目标</td>\n<td>低延迟、强单线程</td>\n<td>高吞吐、弱单线程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>执行单元</td>\n<td>数十个乱序超标量核</td>\n<td>上百个 SM × 每 SM 数十条 warp</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>缓存策略</td>\n<td>大容量多级缓存吸收延迟</td>\n<td>小缓存，用并发 warp 隐藏延迟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>控制流</td>\n<td>分支预测 + 乱序执行</td>\n<td>SIMT，分支发散串行化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>显存/内存</td>\n<td>DDR5，百 GB/s 级</td>\n<td>HBM3e，TB/s 级带宽</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型瓶颈</td>\n<td>依赖链、分支</td>\n<td>显存带宽、寄存器/shared memory 占用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"sm-微架构-warp-simt-与延迟隐藏\">SM 微架构：warp、SIMT 与延迟隐藏</h2><p><strong>warp 是硬件调度与执行的最小单位，固定为 32 个线程</strong>（NVIDIA CUDA C Programming Guide, §&quot;SIMT Architecture&quot;）。程序员写的是 thread，硬件发射的是 warp：同一条指令在 32 个线程上同时执行，这就是 SIMT（Single Instruction, Multiple Threads）。它在多数情况下等价于免费的 32 路 SIMD，但代价出现在<strong>分支发散</strong>上——当一个 warp 内 32 个线程走了不同分支，硬件只能把各条路径串行执行、用掩码屏蔽不参与的线程，于是理论吞吐按发散路径数打折。这就是为什么 GPU 代码里 <code>if (tid % 2)</code> 这类写法要尽量避免，也是&quot;同一 warp 内线程访存要连续&quot;这条经验的来源。</p>\n<p>每个 SM 内部有若干 <strong>warp 调度器</strong>（Ampere/Hopper 为 4 个），每个调度器每个时钟周期挑出一条<strong>就绪</strong>的 warp 发射指令。关键工程含义是：<strong>延迟不是靠缓存隐藏的，是靠 warp 数量隐藏的</strong>。一条全局访存指令的延迟在 400–800 个时钟周期量级，若某个 warp 只有 8 个活跃 warp 待命，调度器就会空转。于是 GPU 性能的核心指标是 <strong>occupancy（占用率）</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>每 SM 实际驻留的活跃 warp 数</mtext><mtext>每 SM 最大可驻留 warp 数</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O = \\frac{\\text{每 SM 实际驻留的活跃 warp 数}}{\\text{每 SM 最大可驻留 warp 数}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2408em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">每</span><span class=\"mord\"> SM </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">最大可驻留</span><span class=\"mord\"> warp </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">数</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">每</span><span class=\"mord\"> SM </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">实际驻留的活跃</span><span class=\"mord\"> warp </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">数</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>Hopper/Ampere 单 SM 最多驻留 <strong>64 个 warp（2048 线程）</strong>，寄存器文件为 <strong>256KB/SM</strong>（65536 个 32-bit 寄存器）。一个 block 的 warp 数、每线程寄存器数、shared memory 用量，三者共同决定 SM 上能同时放下几个 block：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>寄存器</strong>：一个 256 线程的 block，每线程用 128 个寄存器，就要 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>256</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>128</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>32768</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">256 \\times 128 = 32768</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">256</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">128</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">32768</span></span></span></span></span> 个寄存器，占满一半寄存器文件，于是 SM 上最多放 2 个这样的 block（16 个 warp），occupancy 只有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>16</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>64</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>25</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">16/64 = 25\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16/64</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">25%</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li><strong>shared memory</strong>：H100 每 SM 可配置最多 <strong>228KB</strong> 的 shared memory/L1 组合。若一个 block 要 100KB shared memory，SM 上只能放 1 个。</li>\n<li><strong>warp 槽位</strong>：即使寄存器和 shared memory 都够，每 SM 的 block 数上限（通常 32）与 warp 数上限（64）仍会封顶。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这就是&quot;空闲 80GB 显存却 OOM&quot;的第一个真相：<strong>CUDA 的 OOM 经常是寄存器或 shared memory 的分配失败，而不是显存字节不够</strong>。<code>nvidia-smi</code> 看不到这些片上资源，Kubernetes 更看不到。</p>\n<h2 id=\"cuda-执行模型-内存层级与量化约束\">CUDA 执行模型：内存层级与量化约束</h2><p>把上面三样资源写成可计算的模型，就得到调度决策的依据。一次 kernel 启动的<strong>并发度</strong>受限于：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>blocks/SM</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">⌊</mo><mfrac><mn>65536</mn><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>thread</mtext></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>block</mtext></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">⌋</mo></mrow><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">⌊</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>SM</mtext></msub><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>block</mtext></msub></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">⌋</mo></mrow><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">⌊</mo><mfrac><mn>64</mn><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌈</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>block</mtext></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>32</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌉</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">⌋</mo></mrow><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{blocks/SM} = \\min\\left(\\left\\lfloor \\frac{65536}{R_{\\text{thread}} \\times T_{\\text{block}}} \\right\\rfloor, \\left\\lfloor \\frac{S_{\\text{SM}}}{S_{\\text{block}}} \\right\\rfloor, B_{\\max}, \\left\\lfloor \\frac{64}{\\lceil T_{\\text{block}}/32 \\rceil} \\right\\rfloor\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">blocks/SM</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">⌊</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">thread</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">block</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">65536</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">⌋</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">⌊</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">block</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">SM</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">⌋</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">⌊</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">⌈</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">block</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/32</span><span class=\"mclose\">⌉</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">64</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">⌋</span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>thread</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{\\text{thread}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">thread</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是每线程寄存器数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>block</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{block}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">block</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是 block 线程数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>block</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_{\\text{block}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">block</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是每 block 的 shared memory 字节数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B_{\\max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是每 SM 的 block 数硬上限。内存层级的延迟差是另一个必须记住的量级：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>位置</th>\n<th>延迟量级</th>\n<th>容量（H100 级）</th>\n<th>可见范围</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Register</td>\n<td>SM 内</td>\n<td>~1 周期</td>\n<td>256KB/SM</td>\n<td>单线程私有</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Shared Memory / L1</td>\n<td>SM 内</td>\n<td>~20–30 周期</td>\n<td>最多 228KB/SM</td>\n<td>单 block 内共享</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L2</td>\n<td>全卡</td>\n<td>~200 周期</td>\n<td>50MB 级</td>\n<td>全卡共享</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HBM3/HBM3e</td>\n<td>板载</td>\n<td>~400–800 周期</td>\n<td>80GB / 192GB</td>\n<td>全卡共享</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NVLink（跨卡）</td>\n<td>卡间</td>\n<td>~1 微秒级</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>同域多卡</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这张表是后面所有 GPU 共享方案的物理底稿。时间片切分（time-slicing）让多个进程轮流占用整卡，上下文切换要把寄存器与 shared memory 换出，切换开销与显存都不共享；MPS（Multi-Process Service）让多个进程的 kernel 在同一个 SM 上并发，共享的是 SM 的 warp 槽位与 L2；MIG（Multi-Instance GPU）则在硬件层把 SM、L2 slice 与显存控制器切成互不干扰的实例。三者的隔离强度与&quot;能否真正共享显存&quot;完全由上面这张表决定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"硬件代际-从-a100-到-blackwell-的可核验规格\">硬件代际：从 A100 到 Blackwell 的可核验规格</h2><p>Kubernetes 里的 GPU 型号决定节点池的划分方式，也决定 device plugin 上报的资源名与调度器的拓扑约束能力。以下数据取自 NVIDIA 官方架构白皮书（H100 Tensor Core GPU Architecture Whitepaper、NVIDIA Blackwell Architecture Technical Brief）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>型号</th>\n<th>架构 / 计算能力</th>\n<th>SM 数</th>\n<th>显存</th>\n<th>显存带宽</th>\n<th>卡间互联</th>\n<th>稀疏 FP16 / FP8 峰值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>A100 SXM</td>\n<td>Ampere / sm_80</td>\n<td>108</td>\n<td>80GB HBM2e</td>\n<td>2.0 TB/s</td>\n<td>NVLink 3，600GB/s</td>\n<td>624 TFLOPS FP16</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>H100 SXM</td>\n<td>Hopper / sm_90</td>\n<td>132</td>\n<td>80GB HBM3</td>\n<td>3.35 TB/s</td>\n<td>NVLink 4，900GB/s</td>\n<td>~1979 TFLOPS FP16</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>B200</td>\n<td>Blackwell / sm_100</td>\n<td>双 die 封装</td>\n<td>192GB HBM3e</td>\n<td>8 TB/s</td>\n<td>NVLink 5，1.8TB/s</td>\n<td>FP4 稠密 20 PFLOPS 级</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>三个容易被忽略的工程事实。<strong>其一，SM 数不是越大越好地线性换算</strong>：H100 的 132 个 SM 与 16896 个 FP32 核心是同一件事的两种计数（每 SM 128 个 FP32 核心）。<strong>其二，Blackwell 走双 die 封装 + NV-HBI 高带宽 die 间互联</strong>，两个 die 对软件呈现为一张卡，但显存与 L2 的分布意味着跨 die 访存并非零成本——这也是为什么 MIG 与拓扑感知调度在新一代上更需要显式建模。<strong>其三，软件栈门槛在抬升</strong>：CUDA Toolkit 13（2025 年发布）把最低支持的计算能力提升到 7.5（Turing），Maxwell/Pascal/Volta 失去新工具链支持，集群里混着老卡的节点池在做镜像与运行时统一时必须显式处理这个分界（NVIDIA CUDA Toolkit 13.0 Release Notes）。</p>\n<p>在机架尺度上，GB200 NVL72 把 72 张 Blackwell GPU 与 36 颗 Grace CPU 放进一个 NVLink 域，对外呈现为一块约 13.5TB 显存的逻辑加速器（NVIDIA GB200 NVL72 产品页）。这类&quot;超节点&quot;是训练集群拓扑感知调度的核心场景：pod 一旦跨越多个 NVLink 域，集合通信带宽会掉一个数量级。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从设备模型到调度器-为什么这一层决定-k8s-行为\">从设备模型到调度器：为什么这一层决定 K8s 行为</h2><p>Kubernetes 对 GPU 一无所知，它对 GPU 的全部认知来自 <strong>device plugin</strong>：一个以 DaemonSet 部署在节点上的 gRPC 服务，通过 <code>ListAndWatch</code> 把设备清单上报给 kubelet，通过 <code>Allocate</code> 在 pod 启动时准备设备（NVIDIA device plugin for Kubernetes, GitHub <code>NVIDIA/k8s-device-plugin</code>）。它暴露的资源名是 <code>nvidia.com/gpu</code>，<strong>值域是整数</strong>——这是整个 GPU 调度工程最硬的约束来源。</p>\n<p>于是有了三条直接从硬件模型推导出来的结论。<strong>默认不可超卖，也不可分割</strong>：Kubernetes 的扩展资源按整数计数且不能被两个 pod 共享，所以一张 H100 默认就是一个不可分的 <code>nvidia.com/gpu: 1</code>，想一卡多 pod 只能在 device plugin 上游做文章（MPS / time-slicing / MIG），这正是第三章的主题。<strong>调度器看不见 SM 与显存</strong>：kube-scheduler 只知道&quot;这张节点还有 4 个 GPU 名额&quot;，不知道每个 pod 需要多少寄存器、shared memory 或带宽，把两个大模型推理 pod 背靠背放进同一个 MIG 实例，显存够、SM 却撞车，吞吐塌方就是这么发生的。<strong>拓扑是节点级的属性，不是 pod 级的</strong>：NVLink 域、NUMA 与 PCIe 拓扑来自节点事实，调度器要靠 device plugin 上报的拓扑信息 + Topology Manager 策略才能做&quot;同域优先&quot;的判断（NVIDIA GPU Operator 文档，Topology Manager 章节），这一层是第二章的内容。</p>\n<p>把这三条与设备模型对上，就能理解为什么 K8s 上的 GPU 调度远比其他资源类型复杂：其他资源（CPU、内存）是可压缩、可超卖的连续量，GPU 是<strong>不可压缩的离散量</strong>，而它内部的执行资源（warp 槽位、寄存器、shared memory、带宽）又是连续的、但被 device plugin 屏蔽掉了。整个 GPU 调度工程，本质上就是在这道&quot;离散接口 / 连续内部&quot;的裂缝上搭桥。</p>\n<p>本章下一篇（<a href=\"nvidia-device-plugin-registration\">device plugin 的设备发现与注册</a>）会深入 device plugin、GPU Operator 与 CRI 侧的接线细节，把上面这三条结论落到具体的注册协议上；调度与拓扑约束的完整展开则在第二章。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>CUDA 三层容器 thread → block → grid 对应硬件 warp → SM → 全卡；block 内可廉价协作，block 间只能走 global memory。</li>\n<li>warp 固定 32 线程，SIMT 下分支发散会串行化路径；性能靠<strong>并发 warp 数</strong>隐藏延迟，而非缓存。</li>\n<li>occupancy <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>=</mo><mtext>活跃 warp</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>64</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O = \\text{活跃 warp} / 64</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">活跃</span><span class=\"mord\"> warp</span></span><span class=\"mord\">/64</span></span></span></span></span>，受寄存器（65536/SM）、shared memory（最多 228KB/SM）、warp/block 上限三者共同封顶；CUDA 的 OOM 常来自片上资源而非显存字节。</li>\n<li>内存层级从 register（1 周期）到 HBM（数百周期）跨三个数量级，这个梯度决定了时间片 / MPS / MIG 三种切分方案在隔离强度与共享能力上的根本差异。</li>\n<li>Kubernetes 只通过 device plugin 看到整数 <code>nvidia.com/gpu</code>，既不能超卖也不能分割，且完全看不到 SM、显存带宽与拓扑——这是后面所有切分与拓扑调度方案的出发点。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"GPU 硬件架构与 CUDA 执行模型","id":"gpu-硬件架构与-cuda-执行模型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：三层执行层级与两种并行","id":"核心概念-三层执行层级与两种并行"},{"level":2,"text":"SM 微架构：warp、SIMT 与延迟隐藏","id":"sm-微架构-warp-simt-与延迟隐藏"},{"level":2,"text":"CUDA 执行模型：内存层级与量化约束","id":"cuda-执行模型-内存层级与量化约束"},{"level":2,"text":"硬件代际：从 A100 到 Blackwell 的可核验规格","id":"硬件代际-从-a100-到-blackwell-的可核验规格"},{"level":2,"text":"从设备模型到调度器：为什么这一层决定 K8s 行为","id":"从设备模型到调度器-为什么这一层决定-k8s-行为"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"NVIDIA device plugin 的设备发现与注册","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/gpu-kubernetes-scheduling-device-plugin-sharing/gpu-device-model-k8s/nvidia-device-plugin-registration"}}